  {
   "kind": "text",
   "id": "instruction",
   "text": "Use Heat controls to put each listed output in MAN and remove gas/oil demand; close both fuel shutdown valves. Keep ID-301 ventilation available. The simulator may latch its reaction trip after flame disappears; do not bypass or reset that protection.",
